== fm-spawn-ak-lifecycle-policy
ok - inherited empty or contrary values never replace the unattended policy and Firstmate supervisor
ok - a compound raw launch carries the unattended policy and Firstmate supervisor
ok - only the safe raw Codex form runs through the Codex launcher, and every other raw Codex form refuses
ok - a raw non-Codex command that names codex refuses, and one that never names it spawns
ok - relaunch rebuilds the unattended policy and Firstmate supervisor in both allowlist postures
exit=
== fm-backend-t3code
ok - fm_busy_classify: t3code native busy, idle, and unknown are trusted without a record
ok - fm-control-lib: t3code key set, state-verified, no-exit, and no-replacement membership
ok - fm-control.sh backend=t3code: exit refuses before any call (V2 has no session stop); interrupt ends the turn natively
ok - fm-control.sh relaunch backend=t3code: refused before anything is stopped, by the control plane and by the launch owner
not ok - a worker env block carries the task inbox and Git hook with the launch environment
exit=
